I want to print a 600 mm high, 1.5 m long wall with two filaments across the thickness, 25 mm nozzle, 50 mm/s, open time 60 min. The material has a static yield stress of 3 kPa and Athix of 1 Pa/s. Is it printable, and what is the layer cycle-time window?
