Figure~\ref{fig:caseJ01} uses the same wall geometry in an inverse-design request with composition bounds and a strength target. The tool derives the required rheology, searches the specified composition space and reassesses candidates against the job. No sampled mix meets the original screening criteria. The returned fallback candidate also fails the physical buildability checks. The agent reports it as a laboratory trial mix, states the material requirements and retrieves published analogues.

